---
title: All schemas below live in one shared PostgreSQL instance and database — "ucms" — isolated from each other by per-service database roles, not separate databases
---
flowchart TB
    GW["API Gateway"]

    IAM["1. Identity and Access Service<br/>Login, Users, Roles and Permissions, Profile"]
    IAMSCHEMA[("ucms.identity_access")]
    IAM --- IAMSCHEMA

    ACAD["2. Academic Structure Service<br/>Calendar, Programs, Curriculum, Catalog, Offerings"]
    ACADSCHEMA[("ucms.academic")]
    ACAD --- ACADSCHEMA

    ENR["3. Enrollment Service<br/>Program and Course Registration, Capacity, Waitlist"]
    ENRSCHEMA[("ucms.enrollment")]
    ENR --- ENRSCHEMA

    GRADE["4. Assignment and Grading Service<br/>Assignments, Submissions, Grading"]
    GRADESCHEMA[("ucms.assignment_grading")]
    GRADE --- GRADESCHEMA

    NOTIF["5. Notification Service<br/>Email and In-App Notifications"]
    NOTIFSCHEMA[("ucms.notification")]
    NOTIF --- NOTIFSCHEMA

    ANALYTICS["6. Analytics and Reporting Service<br/>Dashboards, Reports"]
    ANALYTICSSCHEMA[("ucms.analytics")]
    ANALYTICS --- ANALYTICSSCHEMA

    REF["7. Reference Data Service<br/>Faculties, Grading Scales, Categories"]
    REFSCHEMA[("ucms.reference_data")]
    REF --- REFSCHEMA

    GW --> IAM
    GW --> ACAD
    GW --> ENR
    GW --> GRADE
    GW --> ANALYTICS
    GW --> REF

    ENR -->|validates| ACAD
    ACAD -->|resolves| REF
    GRADE -->|validates| ENR
    GRADE -->|resolves| REF

    MQ{{Message Broker}}
    ENR -.-> MQ
    GRADE -.-> MQ
    ACAD -.-> MQ
    IAM -.-> MQ
    MQ -.-> NOTIF
    MQ -.-> ANALYTICS

    ANALYTICS -->|reads| IAM
    ANALYTICS -->|reads| ACAD
    ANALYTICS -->|reads| ENR
    ANALYTICS -->|reads| GRADE

